window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>The hot mess Christmas express…</i></b></p> <p>Megelle Island is full of supernatural creatures. I came here a few years ago to be among my own kind, to not worry that I’d accidentally shift into a raccoon or turn invisible in front of some poor human. My clumsiness was going to expose us all to the public and get me into big trouble with the angels.</p> <p>The only problem is…I’m the only jinn here.</p> <p>I knew there weren’t many of us in existence but <i>none </i>was a whole lot less than expected. That left me the third wheel of the entire island. I thought things couldn’t get any worse and then my clumsiness claimed Prince Mateo Vauntero as its newest victim. Just when I think the King and Queen are going to lock me into a prison for the rest of my life, fate paints a different picture. My happily ever after is on the horizon, just within my reach…</p> <p>And then Nash Vauntero walked in, Mateo’s <i>twin, </i>and ruins everything.<br> <br> <b>*Part of a mini-series but can be listened to as a standalone, in any order with the others</b></p>"; 
